WEBVTT

00:02:58.883 --> 00:03:00.593
And why blockchain?

00:03:00.635 --> 00:03:03.554
Blockchain helps
because it's not my blockchain

00:03:03.596 --> 00:03:04.931
or your blockchain,

00:03:04.931 --> 00:03:07.183
it's the neutral blockchain network.

00:03:07.225 --> 00:03:11.312
And that way it makes collaboration
among aid organizations much easier.

00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:12.772
And how does it work?

00:03:13.105 --> 00:03:14.273
Every month,

00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:18.444
aid organizations transfer money
to individual blockchain accounts,

00:03:18.486 --> 00:03:21.405
and then that individual
can go into a store,

00:03:21.405 --> 00:03:22.573
shop for the groceries

00:03:22.615 --> 00:03:25.326
and at the checkout
they pay with the iris scan

00:03:25.368 --> 00:03:27.787
or with another authentication method.

00:03:28.329 --> 00:03:30.957
That innovation had first
been submitted to us